  "description": "Nalix.Runtime provides the core packet processing and middleware infrastructure for the Nalix ecosystem. It includes the middleware pipeline orchestration, packet dispatching channels, and execution management needed to handle message-oriented traffic with high efficiency and low latency.\n\nIt serves as the foundation for building complex message-processing workflows, offering a modular and extensible architecture that decouples transport logic from application-level packet handling.",
